    DialogueText: There's been a few suspect events. Sparks and bangs, strange folk
      acting aloof.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: "Actually \u2014 saw a bloke get zapped by some smackhead by the
        Jones' last week. Thought I'd had some dodgy bud."
